GameRecomp-Recompiler SDK — NOTICE
==================================

SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-only

This project is licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 only
(see LICENSE). It is a thin client SDK that locates and invokes the GameReComp
CLI (`game-recomp-cli run`) and reads its JSON report; it does not contain a
second recompiler, loader or lifter.

No third-party recompiler, loader or lifter source is copied into this
repository. All four bindings (C, C++, Rust, Python) use only their language
and platform standard libraries; the Rust crate has no external dependencies.

